<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Menstrual health remains a critical yet neglected issue in many tribal communities of Ri-Bhoi District. Economic hardship forces women, often in households with three or more females, to rely on unsafe alternatives like old cloths fastened with safety pins, increasing the risk of infections and injuries. Cultural taboos and lack of awareness continue to deepen the silence and stigma around menstruation.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
