460 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Vishakha Journey towards Menstrual Health  Vishakha Shadap, 39 years old, a dedicated teacher at Umtyrnga Presbyterian School with over 20 years of teaching experience, She is one of the school's most seasoned educators. She's been actively involved in various programs and activities, but one initiative inspired her, i.e. the awareness and introduction of reusable sanitary pads by MOSONiE SEF & Project BAALA. Previously, She used cotton cloth, but leakage issues led her to opt for disposable pads, despite feeling guilty about the environmental impact. Now, she's thrilled to receive BAALA reusable sanitary pads, praising their softness and ease of washing. Confident in their effectiveness, she is eager to share her experience with students and friends, promoting sustainable menstrual hygiene practices. Her enthusiasm embodies the positive change reusable sanitary pads can bring, empowering women and supporting a healthier environment.)
/E (Vishakha Journey towards Menstrual Health  Vishakha Shadap, 39 years old, a dedicated teacher at Umtyrnga Presbyterian School with over 20 years of teaching experience, She is one of the school's most seasoned educators. She's been actively involved in various programs and activities, but one initiative inspired her, i.e. the awareness and introduction of reusable sanitary pads by MOSONiE SEF & Project BAALA. Previously, She used cotton cloth, but leakage issues led her to opt for disposable pads, despite feeling guilty about the environmental impact. Now, she's thrilled to receive BAALA reusable sanitary pads, praising their softness and ease of washing. Confident in their effectiveness, she is eager to share her experience with students and friends, promoting sustainable menstrual hygiene practices. Her enthusiasm embodies the positive change reusable sanitary pads can bring, empowering women and supporting a healthier environment.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
